      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1958926550079783192",
      "text": "[3:46PM] #MobolajiBankAnthonyWay #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular movement from Idiroko towards Maryland intersection is generally good, though there is a slight delay approaching the intersection due to traffic lights regulating flow into Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way, as well as towards Ojota axis.\n\nTraffic along Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way towards NITEL Junction remains steady, with minor delays from Customs/Unity down to the General Hospital underbridge, while the return journey is smooth.\n\nMovement from Kodesho towards the Ikeja underbridge is slow, attributed to the evening rush, though the return trip is free-flowing. Oba Akran Avenue, Airport Road, and Oba Akinjobi Road all have good vehicular flow.\n\nNo major obstructions reported, as personnel remain on ground effectively managing traffic situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
