      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1958949719494820035",
      "text": "[6:46PM] #Jibowu_Yaba_Oyingbo #TrafficUpdate \n\nAdekunle intersection to 3rd Mainland Bridge, Makoko Junction, Panti, and Alagomeji are experiencing smooth movement. \nHowever, approaching Sabo is congested due to traffic light alternations. \nOther routes like St. Agnes to Unilag Junction, Jibowu underneath the bridge, Yaba Phase 1 and 2, Murtala Muhammad to Oyingbo, and Oyingbo to Iddo are moving well. \nKano Street to Adekunle is moving steadily. No impediments are reported, and officers are on ground managing traffic effectively.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
